{Khaziut lic bok meuz beung
  "Angmok mi": {
    "1": {
      "1": "Angmok meumok tha, Geumeu mic mok nang meux chiuxoh.",
      "2": "Meux na angphi meqe' dagac' yiuli, chiun chiuncdeu neu na, reunyeung athang thak kax siumak ngoli, Geumeu pheulax na, changaf thak ka shiudem se."
      "3": "Geumeu mic gac neu la ne neuk, wali gen notha, gac neu anec ani.",
      "4": "Gac neu na,, siula ohneu Geumeu mic rax batha, angmic gac neu nang chiun deu neu avec aba."
      "5": "Gac neuka, Geumeu mic ayac' lenc noli, chiuncdeu neu kana ashiuc lenc no.",
      "6": "Geumeu mic changaf ka, dihang demc mok shiulim la ane neuk, wali gen notha, ohyoc aphoq je."
      "7": "Ohtha angmic changaf kana, mok shiulim thak nang euphang avec aba.",
      "8": "Geumeu mic mok shiulim kana mok lenc aba. Ohthana ashiuc bi jeli gac ani tha anyiu nyiu wa nyiu ye."
      "9": "Geumeu mic asa song' ane neuk yoca mok shiulim phang changaf ka, thasic la diheum beu, wali gen notha ohyoc aphoq je.",
      "10": "Ohtha Geumeu mic asa song' kana sademc lenc noli, thasic diheum je changaf ka salangwa meux lenc no. Yaneu na siula e, wali Geumeu mic rax aba."
      "11": "Ohneu rang Geumeu mic asademc ka, shiun angchiu chiux nang angyeux aneoh ken angchiu chiux, angshiuc ziuoh sheungzeungc longc zeungc layoq je.",
      "12": "Asademc kana, shiun angchiu chiux, ken angchiu chiux angshiuc ziuoh siuzeungc longc zeung angchiu chiux yoq ani."
      "13": "Yadang chiux na siula e, wali Geumeu mic rax aba. Ohtha ashiuc bi jeli gac anitha asium nyiu wanyiu ye."
